{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110248752569360384"]}, "author_id": "62762183", "created_at": "2026-10-14T05:58:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110248778200682765"], "id": "2110248778200682765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 494, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "More than 100 kg of genuine gold ornaments have been used to adorn Goddess Durga and other idols at a gold-themed Durga Puja pandal in Siliguri, West Bengal. Inaugurated by BJP MP from Jalpaiguri, Dr Jayanta Roy, the pandal features golden-themed decorations that complement the https://t.co/bzlRoblDJA", "url": "https://x.com/Openthemag/status/2110248778200682765"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110207034285232128"]}, "author_id": "1554085338364067842", "created_at": "2026-10-14T03:12:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110207050877993204"], "id": "2110207050877993204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "#কর্মসূচি: দুর্গাপূজার মণ্ডপ উদ্বোধন\n#ক্লাব: গান্ধী পল্লী বিবেকানন্দ স্পোর্টিং ক্লাব, বনগাঁ\nহিন্দু হৃদয়ের সম্রাট পশ্চিমবঙ্গ সরকারের মুখ্যমন্ত্রী মাননীয় শুভেন্দু অধিকারী মহাশয় কে বনগাঁ ৫ নং ওয়ার্ডের সমাজসেবী মাননীয় অলোকেশ ঘোষের সংবর্ধনা জ্ঞাপন।\n@bjpNabadwipZone @SuvenduWB https://t.co/udOeOMlv6V", "url": "https://x.com/BongaBJPBarta/status/2110207050877993204"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110148425769738240"]}, "author_id": "355989081", "created_at": "2026-10-13T23:20:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110148600722489509"], "id": "2110148600722489509", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 56616, "like_count": 1195, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 132}, "text": "#WATCH | Kolkata, West Bengal: A high-level delegation of foreign ambassadors, consuls general, and international representatives visited several prominent Durga Puja p