"author_id": "3868003454", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109912846398271869"], "id": "2109912846398271869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 63, "impression_count": 4315, "like_count": 108, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109684043096965608", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ", "url": "https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"}, {"author_id": "740846832755052545", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109904974893474142"], "id": "2109904974893474142", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1526603809635856384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109882876057837846", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Amit4Films @Parthib777 @Exoteric_savy I love pandal hopping but physically I’m not very capable. Also I can’t do the all nighter. But manage to see at least 20-30 pandal every year. Start with South. On Chaturthi. Suruchi, Ekdalia, Hindustan park, Tridhara, Deshopriya  and Ballygaunge cultural. the most famous ones.", "url": "https://x.com/RitzyB94/status/2109904974893474142"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109717180313124864", "3_2109717180321538048", "3_2109717180317376512", "3_2109717180329893889"]}, "author_id": "1138322180008136704", "created_at": "2026-10-12T18:45:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109717228019171449"], "id": "2109717228019171449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1145, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Glimp